  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Überwachung von besonders gefährlichen Schadorganismen für den Wald – Jahresbericht 2025. Surveillance des organismes nuisibles particulièrement dangereux pour la forêt – Rapport annuel 2025. Monitoraggio degli organismi nocivi particolarmente pericolosi per il bosco – Rapporto annuale 2025. Surveillance of organisms&lt;br /&gt;particularly harmful to forests – Annual report 2025 (2026), published by Eidg. Forschungsanstalt für Wald, Schnee und Landschaft WSL, has no recorded citations, downloads or public discussion yet. This is an early record rather than a quiet one — the signals collected for it so far are thin.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Überwachung von besonders gefährlichen Schadorganismen für den Wald – Jahresbericht 2025. Surveillance des organismes nuisibles particulièrement dangereux pour la forêt – Rapport annuel 2025. Monitoraggio degli organismi nocivi particolarmente pericolosi per il bosco – Rapporto annuale 2025. Surveillance of organisms&lt;br /&gt;particularly harmful to forests – Annual report 2025 by Valentin Queloz, Beat Ruffner, Doris Hölling and others was published by Eidg. Forschungsanstalt für Wald, Schnee und Landschaft WSL in 2026. It is part of the WSL-Berichte/WSL Berichte series. Conceptually, the work connects to Humanities, Biology, Electrocution, Geography and Medicine.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">No teaching use, downloads or public discussion have been recorded for it yet.</p>",
